Package: hvtiRimputation
Title: Missing Value Imputation for the HVTI CORR Group
Version: 0.1.4
Authors@R:
    person("John", "Ehrlinger", , "ehrlinj@ccf.org", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Fills missing values in a data frame by a stated method and
    returns the filled data together with a row-level record of exactly
    which values were changed. Ports the mean-imputation behaviour of the
    'SAS' library of the Cardiovascular Outcomes, Registries and Research
    (CORR) group of the Heart, Vascular and Thoracic Institute (HVTI) at the
    Cleveland Clinic -- 'PROC STANDARD' with 'REPLACE', and the 'imputsub'
    macro that wraps it. The package knows nothing about the warehouse, a
    build, or any study: the input is a data frame and the output is a data
    frame plus a record.
License: GPL-3
URL: https://github.com/ehrlinger/hvtiRimputation, https://ehrlinger.github.io/hvtiRimputation/
BugReports: https://github.com/ehrlinger/hvtiRimputation/issues
